Description: NASty engine and metrics collector (Debian)
 JSON-RPC engine and Prometheus metrics collector for the NASty NAS
 appliance. Built for Debian Trixie on armhf (QNAP TS-228 / RTD1195)
 and other architectures.
 .
 SMB file sharing uses ksmbd; FTP, SFTP, and S3 use rclone serve.
 System upgrades use apt with snapper btrfs snapshots for rollback.

